regime is products consumed across producer restarts, and arming it changes the P/B/C record bytes.  Add back with the seam work on a re-validated posture.\", \"network.phase_leveling_local_block\": \"scope cut of the re-founding decision: 'no F3' (scripts/make_refound_config.py DROP: 'F3 off (decision)').  The F3 station-wide whitened local block was validated on the retired GPS+Galileo triple sim lineage; on this posture it is a candidate to add back, one thing at a time, with its own arm on both beds.\", \"network.phase_leveling_los_scale\": \"F1 is the per-LOS B_eff scale that F3 superseded; the re-founding decision cut F3 and nothing of the F-family was carried onto this posture (RF-0 base).  Unvalidated here - add back (F1 or F3) as its own arm on both beds.\"}",
